Subject: [PATCH] Campaigns: place the reserve button anywhere in the message

A [button] line in the message is where the reserve button appears, so it
can sit between paragraphs or anywhere else. The new + Button control in
the toolbar inserts that line at the cursor and switches the button on.
Without a [button] line the button stays at the bottom, as before. The
preview and the campaign history show the button in its place.

Also keeps Mailchimp merge tags such as *|FNAME|* from being read as
italic by the text formatter.

